    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Figure it Out!&quot;</strong> is a puzzle and deduction game where you will have to take a series of figures from one point to another. Finding out how the elements that make up the levels work is part of the experience.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Figure it Out! is:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2-3 hour experience</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our first game (cooked with a lot of love) ^^</p></li></ul>",
